    "kx.countdown.accessibility.remaining %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of a deal countdown. %@ is a comma-separated list of the days, hours and minutes fragments, e.g. '2 Tagen, 3 Stunden, 4 Minuten'. The fragments are grammatically adapted to follow this phrase. Not shown visually.",
